OL,3,GNEWSAMilton Keynes makes 2029 City of
OL,4,ACulture shortlist
OL,5,
OL,6,FMilton Keynes has made the shortlist to
OL,7,Fbe named as the 2029 City of Culture.
OL,9,FIt was only given the civic honour of
OL,10,Fcity status in 2022, as part of the
OL,11,FQueen's Platinum Jubilee celebrations,
OL,12,Fbut is now one of four places competing
OL,13,Ffor the prize, which will be awarded
OL,14,Fearly next year.
OL,16,FIt will compete with Wrexham, Sheffield
OL,17,Fand Blackpool for the accolade, with a
OL,18,Fpanel of judges including the creator
OL,19,Fof Grange Hill, Brookside and
OL,20,FHollyoaks, Sir Phil Redmond, due to
OL,21,Fvisit each one before making a final
OL,22,Fdecision.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
