OL,3,GNEWSAMilton Keynes makes 2029 City of
OL,4,ACulture shortlist
OL,5,
OL,6,FJane Carr, the Liberal Democrat leader
OL,7,Fof the city council, said: "This is a
OL,8,Fhuge honour and a tribute to the hard
OL,9,Fwork and vision of everyone who has
OL,10,Fhelped to shape Milton Keynes' bid."
